TI  - OpenChat: Advancing Open-source Language Models with Mixed-Quality Data
AU  - Guan Wang
AU  - Sijie Cheng
AU  - Xianyuan Zhan
AU  - Xiangang Li
AU  - Sen Song
AU  - Yang Liu
