TI  - WebRL: Training LLM Web Agents via Self-Evolving Online Curriculum Reinforcement Learning
AU  - Zehan Qi
AU  - Xiao Liu
AU  - Iat Long Iong
AU  - Hanyu Lai
AU  - Xueqiao Sun
